// nova_ternary_tools_service.nova -- NovaX Ternary Toolkit v1.0 (port 9894)
// Pure NovaLang port of nova_ternary_tools.py
//
// 7 Core Tools + TFilter + TFlow built on 3-5-7-13 Harmonics:
//   1. TDiff   -- Ternary 3-state diff (added/unchanged/removed = +1/0/-1)
//   2. TCache  -- In-memory cache with 3-tier eviction (hot/warm/cold)
//   3. TSync   -- Delta sync via ternary diffs
//   4. TIndex  -- Three-state search index (match/partial/miss)
//   5. TMesh   -- Compressed inter-service relay
//   6. TStream -- Real-time ternary streams
//   7. TForge  -- Reynolds code analyzer (N-S on source code)
//   8. TFilter -- N-S Reynolds text classifier (+1/0/-1)
//   9. TFlow   -- N-S pipe flow router for sessions + downloads
//
// Endpoints:
//   POST /ttools/diff           -- Compute ternary diff
//   POST /ttools/diff/apply     -- Apply ternary diff
//   POST /ttools/cache/set      -- Store in TCache
//   POST /ttools/cache/get      -- Retrieve from TCache
//   GET  /ttools/cache/status   -- Cache stats
//   POST /ttools/sync           -- Delta sync directories
//   POST /ttools/index          -- Index files by ternary fingerprint
//   POST /ttools/search         -- Three-state search
//   POST /ttools/mesh           -- Compressed service relay
//   POST /ttools/stream/start   -- Start compressed stream
//   POST /ttools/stream/write   -- Write to stream
//   GET  /ttools/stream/read    -- Read from stream
//   POST /ttools/forge          -- Reynolds code analysis
//   POST /ttools/filter         -- TFilter: N-S text classifier
//   POST /ttools/flow/message   -- TFlow: route message through pipe
//   POST /ttools/flow/recall    -- TFlow: recall session
//   POST /ttools/flow/download  -- TFlow: download routing strategy
//   GET  /ttools/flow/status    -- TFlow: pipe flow status
//   GET  /ttools/status         -- Full toolkit status
//   GET  /health                -- Health check
//
// N-S Mapping:
//   Re < 27  (3^3)  = laminar      (clean, signal)
//   Re < 125 (5^3)  = transitional (uncertain)
//   Re < 343 (7^3)  = turbulent    (noisy)
//   Re >= 343       = chaotic      (extreme)

// ============================================================================
// SERVER INIT
// ============================================================================

